cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite the article below.
title: "TRUST-Diff: structure-aware partial-correspondence posterior diffusion for unpaired reference-based hyperspectral image super-resolution"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of TRUST-Diff, which treats unpaired
  reference-based hyperspectral image super-resolution as joint posterior
  inference over the image, a partial correspondence and the inter-sensor
  spectral response.
